{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/576564-does-everyone-lose-athletics-in-their-defence-against-gauru-even-other-gauru","id":576564,"title":"Does everyone lose Athletics in their Defence against Gauru, even other Gauru?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-02T10:42:41-07:00","id":576564,"title":"Does everyone lose Athletics in their Defence against Gauru, even other Gauru?","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Primal Fear: Gauru force all lesser enemies \u2014 including<br /> most humans, spirits of lower Rank, and non-supernatural<br /> animals \u2014 to use Down and Dirty combat (see p. 165). If<br /> the prey hides in a group of more powerful enemies, resolve<br /> the combat as normal. In normal combat, opponents<br /> count only their Dexterity or Wits to their Defense; they<br /> may not add the appropriate Skill (normally Athletics). </div> </div> </div>Not sure if I should read the last sentence as being connected to the first one - that lesser enemies lose their Athletics part of their defence if Gauru are forced to fight them in normal combat because of the presence of more dangerous prey, or if it means EVERYONE loses the Athletic part of their defence against someone in Gauru form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2007-wade-l","name":"Wade L","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2007_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"136"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-02T10:53:05-07:00","id":576591,"title":"","content":"Everyone loses Athletics to Defense against Gauru. Lesser opponents use Down and Dirty combat unless they hide among more worthy opponents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-02T11:27:58-07:00","id":576632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/576564-does-everyone-lose-athletics-in-their-defence-against-gauru-even-other-gauru?p=576591#post576591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Everyone loses Athletics to Defense against Gauru. Lesser opponents use Down and Dirty combat unless they hide among more worthy opponents.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Man, that makes Gauru vs Gauru fights even more brutal. You both have higher attack pools <i>and</i> lower defence pools. Although I guess since you need to wrap around into agg to do anything meaningful, that probably isn't a bad thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2007-wade-l","name":"Wade L","avatar":"https://forum.th